    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `synthesize_ssml.py` that synthesizes SSML with voice and prosody controls using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library to interact with Amazon Polly and include the provider-specific client class and model identifier to make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
